              <h3>Different technologies that use code to run</h3>
<p>Let's look at different technologies that use code to run in the following video.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
        <video poster="~/images/svg/poster.svg" controls preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="watch" width="1000"
